@startuml AD-9
!include _style.iuml
title AD-9 (System level) — Handle billing exceptions: manual refunds and e-invoice retry\nTrigger: Admin picks an item on Billing Exceptions, or a Driver closes the account\nUse cases: UC-ADM-08, UC-ACC-02 · Rules: BR-P13, BR-P14, BR-P21, BR-P44, BR-P51\nRefunds are made by customer service (Admin staff) in the VNPay merchant portal, outside PowerMe

|«person»\nDriver|
|«person»\nAdmin|
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
|«external system»\nPayment\nGateway|
|«external system»\nE-Invoice\nProvider|
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
start
if ( ) then ([Admin picks an item])
  |«person»\nAdmin|
  :Open Billing Exceptions\nand choose an item;
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
  if ( ) then ([BR-P44: e-invoice needs review])
    :Send the e-invoice to the provider\nagain, once (attempt count not reset)>
    if ( ) then ([issued by the provider])
      :EInvoice\n&#91;issued&#93;]
    else ([provider error])
      :EInvoice\n&#91;needs_review&#93;]
    endif
    stop
  elseif ( ) then ([top-up to refund])
    :Check that the available\nbalance covers the top-up;
    if ( ) then ([BR-P21: available balance < amount,\naccount closed, or top-up not credited])
      :Refuse with reason;
      stop
    else ([balance covers it])
      :Debit Charging Credit at once,\nreturn redeemed points;
      :TopUp\n&#91;refunded&#93;]
      :LoyaltyTransaction\n&#91;restore&#93;]
    endif
  else ([late payment to refund\n(never credited, nothing debited)])
  endif
else ([Driver closed the account])
  |«person»\nDriver|
  :Confirm closure after the preview\n(refundable, non-refundable amount\nand points forfeited);
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
  if ( ) then ([account not active, a pending top-up,\nor an unsettled charge or session])
    :Refuse closure with reason (MSG23);
    stop
  else ([closure allowed])
  endif
  :Debit unused credit and split it\nover the newest credited top-ups\n(each share ≤ amount paid; the rest\nwritten off by an adjustment);
  :Forfeit remaining points;
  :LoyaltyTransaction\n&#91;expire&#93;]
  :CreditAccount\n&#91;closed&#93;]
endif
:Create refund request (top_up and\nlate_payment: by the Admin, one per top-up;\naccount_closure: by the system, one per share);
:Refund\n&#91;requested&#93;]
:List the refund on Billing Exceptions\nfor customer service;
(A)
|«person»\nAdmin|
:Customer service refunds the amount\nto the original payment source in the\nVNPay merchant portal (outside PowerMe);
|«external system»\nPayment\nGateway|
:Process the refund,\nor refuse it;
|«person»\nAdmin|
if ( ) then ([refused by the gateway])
  :Mark the refund failed,\nwith the reason;
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
  :Refund\n&#91;failed&#93;]
  |«person»\nAdmin|
  :Redo the refund;
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
  :Refund\n&#91;requested&#93;]
  (A)
  detach
else ([refunded])
  :Enter the gateway refund\ntransaction number;
endif
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
if ( ) then ([BR-P51: number already recorded])
  :Reject the number,\nrefund stays requested;
  stop
else ([new number])
endif
:Refund\n&#91;done&#93;]
:Request adjustment invoice\nfor the amount refunded>
|«external system»\nE-Invoice\nProvider|
:Issue adjustment\ninvoice;
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
if ( ) then ([issued])
  :InvoiceAdjustment\n&#91;issued&#93;]
else ([error after\nautomatic retries])
  :InvoiceAdjustment\n&#91;needs_review&#93;]
endif
:Notify Driver that the\nrefund was made (MSG25);
|«person»\nDriver|
:Receive refund\nconfirmation;
stop
@enduml
